cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Paperfox in your research, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "Paperfox"
type: software
abstract: >-
  Paperfox starts from a research question and the papers a researcher already
  trusts, and builds a graded library of related papers with the evidence behind
  every score.
authors:
  - name: "The Paperfox contributors"
    website: "https://github.com/Joevonlong/Paperfox/graphs/contributors"
